sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AP as Access Point
    participant X as Attacker
    participant C as Client
    AP->>C: Message 3
    C->>X: Message 4
    X--xAP: Blocked — never arrives
    Note over AP: Times out
    AP->>C: Message 3 retransmitted
